    "Name": "Grand Titan T-IT-N18M",
    "Details": "The Grand Titan T-IT-N18M was created when the satellite factory producing the standard 400 XL engines suffered a suspected bio-weapon release. As a result the variant swaps in a 300 standard fusion engine with MASC and a Supercharger, pushing its speed well past the norm. It was also refitted for extreme-range combat, carrying an Extended LRM 15 and ER lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
